  | EmFormat UInt64.t
  | EmInit UInt64.t
  | Checkpoint UInt64.t
  | DevSignal UInt64.t
  | DevShutdown UInt64.t
  | DevDetach UInt64.t
  | Register
  | RegWarn
  | Unregister
  | Join
  | Leave
